  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In its current state you can not see the date your friend was last online only a count of days until you reach a month, and then it only updated every time a month has passed. it also isn't even accurate most of the time saying friends i played with the day before haven't been on in weeks. I propose a revamp of the system used to track last online so that it is more informative and works properly. I think it should have a yy/mm/dd counting system so that after a month it isn't impossible to tell how long its been in between months.",
